Paley tournament T_7 (QR tournament on 7 vertices):
  QR mod 7 = {1,2,4}; i→j iff (i-j) mod 7 ∈ {1,2,4}
  H(Paley T_7) = 189  (VERIFIED)
  |Aut(Paley T_7)| = 21 = F_{7,3} = Z_7 ⋊ Z_3  (VERIFIED)
  tile_dist[189] = 9, tile_dist[189]/189 = 1/21
  → tiling distribution DETECTS the Paley automorphism group ✓

n=8 iso-class analysis:
